@startuml Seq_Chat
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
title Sequence diagram --- In-game chat

actor Player
participant "Game chat\n(Angular)" as UI
participant "Server" as S
database "SQLite" as DB

Player -> UI : Types a message in the current game
UI -> S : Send GameMessage (game:{gameId})
S -> DB : Save ChatMessage
DB --> S : Message saved
S --> UI : Message delivered
UI --> Player : Message shown in the game chat
@enduml
